  "note": "Total Assets = Total Liabilities + Equity reconciles exactly. Source PDF -layout extraction glues a spurious extra trailing '0' onto two P&L figures for the Jul-Sep'14 column (net interest income printed as '1,838,693,7850', total operating income as '3,317,974,1730'); both were corrected (to 1,838,693,785 and 3,317,974,173) via the same arithmetic-reconciliation method used throughout this dataset — interest income minus interest paid, and net interest income plus non-interest-income subtotal, both land exactly on the corrected figures. PBT minus tax = net profit exactly; Q1+Q2+Q3 2014 (356,292,858 + 313,889,126 + 740,218,853 = 1,410,400,837) matches the report's own 9M cumulative column exactly."
